  "ingredients": [
    "2 (8 ounce) containers candied cherries",
    "1 (8 ounce) container candied mixed citrus peel",
    "2 (2.25 ounce) packages blanched slivered almonds",
    "2 cups raisins",
    "1 cup dried currants",
    "1 cup dates, pitted and chopped",
    "0.5 cup brandy",
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour, divided",
    "1 teaspoon ground cloves",
    "1 teaspoon ground allspice",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.75 cup molasses",
    "0.75 cup apple juice",
    "1 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "2 cups packed brown sugar",
    "6 large eggs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GO1FMv3mrGut36O-vX75u6tA1mc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-01-71d462a05140471da6c23d0e69ea0e87.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine candied cherries, citrus peel, and almonds in a medium bowl; add raisins, currants, and dates. Pour in brandy; stir to combine. Cover and let sit for 2 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gUwOBANHaSEIMt66Z0FgHijNuLQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-02-20d0cca752d348c5b55ebe3e8359e48a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When ready to bake, preheat the oven to 275 degrees F (135 degrees C). Grease a deep 8-inch fruitcake pan, line it with parchment paper, and grease again.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yg8NHgk_QMOlAxUbjkS-p8-VmZQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-03-74e8a20f33814196999b628b874ff60b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss brandy-soaked fruit with ½ cup flour in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C3Tqx4PMff9CxO4W69BURUsJMi0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-04-49372cd5e21f4122b5b78d7d79f9ddfb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk remaining 2 cups flour, cloves, allspice, cinnamon, baking soda, and salt together in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Pm4SSvu3QlNiPNveando2GyXdGI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-05-926fd30004c54525b3fe8268cc8b7151.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir molasses and apple juice together in a separate bowl until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k_HnIC5oAflK--kR3qCrXsBeSo4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-06-8b51153f044446479cf49d2378612896.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter in a large bowl until light and fluffy; gradually blend in brown sugar and eggs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u3gf8aIexSTRClusfK2QdJUCCy0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-07-1a970eaaba1e4d0ebd57cc4859be9477.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add flour mixture in 4 batches, alternating with molasses mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/olJcRnfferOz9buy6dlbbzLGSFg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-08-94c92580595344b4876897483ef28406.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold in floured fruit. Transfer batter to the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7PhqmoWQnGFaxuZKxMOfSx6S0BE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-09-d242be1cefb44321b995dabb463cd4d7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into center of the cake comes out clean, 3 to 3 ½ hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4gPf2Ic-PfArKIF65YYAFEDagQA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-10-0ae0d5adb92041cfbac141df897b6fd6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove cake from the pan; peel off parchment paper. Cool cake completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NPKh_Pv7tsyRCPmjpYZZ_DBqEw8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-9265-christmas-cake-VAT-step-11-e59aae00bd55468eb2448380e96fdd5b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/9265/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
